            <div xml:id="d630">

                <pb facs="0798" n="684" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg684"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.6463/168: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in the
                        Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-09-29T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 29,
                                1924—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>37. Your 56, September 26, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department informed by Hunt and Dominican Minister that on September 25, they
                    signed the contract of sale of the Santo Domingo <pb facs="0799" n="685"
                        xml:id="pg685"/> Water, Light &amp; Power Company’s properties to the
                    Dominican Government. The terms of this contract are in accordance with
                    statement in your telegram.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
